%% Cross-currency (FX) payment as exercised by
%% docker/ml-testing-toolkit/test-cases/collections/tests/fx/golden_path/feature_tests/happy_path/fx_tests.json
%% (see 04-business-use-cases.md §3.9)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PF as Payer FSP (source currency XXX)
    participant SW as Mojaloop Switch
    participant FXP as FX Provider (testfxp1)
    participant QF as Payee FSP (target currency XTS)

    PF->>SW: GET /parties/MSISDN/{ID}
    SW->>QF: GET /parties/MSISDN/{ID}
    QF-->>SW: PUT /parties (party, supported currency)
    SW-->>PF: PUT /parties
    PF->>SW: GET /services/FXP
    SW-->>PF: PUT /services/FXP {providers}
    PF->>SW: POST /fxQuotes {conversionRequestId, conversionTerms: source XXX, target XTS}
    SW->>FXP: POST /fxQuotes
    FXP-->>SW: PUT /fxQuotes/{id} {conversionTerms with rate, condition}
    SW-->>PF: PUT /fxQuotes/{id}
    PF->>SW: POST /quotes (amount in target currency)
    SW->>QF: POST /quotes
    QF-->>SW: PUT /quotes/{id} {transferAmount, ilpPacket, condition}
    SW-->>PF: PUT /quotes/{id}
    PF->>SW: POST /fxTransfers {commitRequestId, determiningTransferId, sourceAmount, targetAmount, condition}
    SW->>FXP: POST /fxTransfers
    FXP-->>SW: PUT /fxTransfers/{id} {conversionState: RESERVED, fulfilment}
    SW-->>PF: PUT /fxTransfers/{id} (RESERVED)
    PF->>SW: POST /transfers {transferId = determiningTransferId, amount in XTS}
    SW->>QF: POST /transfers
    QF-->>SW: PUT /transfers/{id} {fulfilment, COMMITTED}
    Note over SW: Main transfer commit also commits the dependent FX transfer
    SW-->>PF: PUT /transfers/{id} COMMITTED
    SW-->>FXP: PATCH /fxTransfers/{id} (final state)
